16:43.700 --> 16:44.800
Nan Yanzhi.

16:44.880 --> 16:45.420
Yanzhi.

16:45.190 --> 16:49.890
♪ Untuk mereka ♪

16:45.450 --> 16:46.180
Nona Zhuang.

16:46.900 --> 16:47.370
Kakak.

16:47.380 --> 16:48.110
Nona Zhuang.

16:48.130 --> 16:48.770
Kak Zhuang.

16:48.770 --> 16:49.500
Nan Yanzhi.

16:49.960 --> 16:50.970
- Nan Yanzhi.
- Zhuang Wujiu.

16:50.970 --> 16:51.770
Zhuang Wujiu.

16:53.840 --> 16:55.980
Kalian sudah menepati janji
